<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54731" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά-παστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>besprinkled, bespattered
				with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφάνοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					502
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδυσματίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Telecl.
					1.11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαργὸν τυρῷ κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Archestr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				36.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>suitable for use as a powder</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Asclep.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.159
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>embroidered</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλουργίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					968
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χιτὼν Χρυσῷ κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				72.17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χρυσαῖς ἀκτῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					3.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				10.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				<u>Or.</u>
				17(15).10
			</span></i>.</div>
